SUMMARY:Yolo County Wine Ramble
DESCRIPTION:Ramble around Yolo County’s wine country April 25 & 26\, discovering wines you didn’t know you were missing. \nEach ticket to this year’s Wine Ramble comes with a BOGO flight—buy one ticket\, get a flight for you and a pal! No physical tickets\, just show your email receipt to one of the participating wineries. \n  \nEach winery involved in the Ramble is family-owned\, estate-grown\, and award-winning. Participating wineries include: \n  \n\nBerryessa Gap\nCapay Valley Vineyards\nCollina De Bella\nElevation Ten\nFjord Oak Winery\nGreat Bear Vineyards\nGrindstone Wines\nHeringer Estates\nMatchbook Wine Co.\nTaber Ranch\nTurkovich Family Wines
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/yolo-county-wine-ramble/2026-04-26/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/wines_jan2022-e1638747541962.jpg
END:VEVENT
