SUMMARY:Wine Ramble Weekend
DESCRIPTION:🍷🚗 Yolo County Wine Ramble Weekend at Great Bear Vineyards 🚗🍷\nSunday\, April 26 | 12–3pm\nTicket Includes: BOGO Wine Tastings\nKeep the weekend going and ramble your way through Yolo County wine country! 🌿✨ Make Great Bear Vineyards one of your must-visit stops and discover what you’ve been missing.\nWith your Wine Ramble ticket\, you and a guest enjoy buy one\, get one FREE wine tastings at Great Bear and 11 other participating wineries—so yes\, that’s two Signature Tastings for the price of one. 🍷🍷\n🎶🍽 What’s Happening at Great Bear:\n🎸 Live music by Last Station West\, an acoustic-forward band playing rock\, blues\, country\, & folk music. Their unique sound will have you out of your seat and dancing!\n🥟 Buenos Aires Grill serving up their delicious empanadas\n🍷 Award-winning estate wines in a relaxed vineyard setting\n🍇 The Great Bear Tasting Experience:\nUnwind in our rustic tasting room or peaceful garden while enjoying a guided flight of five estate-grown wines. Our knowledgeable team will serve you tableside\, share the story behind each pour\, and make your tasting both fun and memorable.\n✨ Gather your friends\, plan your route\, and make a day of it—this is your chance to sip\, explore\, and celebrate the best of Yolo County wines.\n🎟 Get your tickets here:\nhttps://www.cellarpass.com/…/wine-ramble-weekend-2026…\nWe can’t wait to welcome you for an afternoon of wine\, music\, and good vibes!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/wine-ramble-weekend-2/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/4-26-26-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
