SUMMARY:Al-Juthoor Dabke and Aswat Ensemble "Take Me to Palestine - خدني ع فلسطين"
DESCRIPTION:Rooted in tradition and alive with momentum\, Al-Juthoor (“Roots”) and Aswat Ensemble unite for a powerful evening of Dabke\, music\, and storytelling. Drawing on dance and sound from across Palestine and the Arab Levant\, this collaboration asserts culture as something lived\, shared\, and carried forward together. \nGrounded footwork\, driving rhythms\, and rich vocals move in constant conversation\, transforming the stage into a space of unity and expression. The performance unfolds in two movements Resistance and Land Back: first\, a stirring exploration of resistance through music\, dance\, and storytelling; then a vision of return\, reclamation\, and resurgence honoring relationships to the land and heritage.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/al-juthoor-dabke-and-aswat-ensemble-take-me-to-palestine-%d8%ae%d8%af%d9%86%d9%8a-%d8%b9-%d9%81%d9%84%d8%b3%d8%b7%d9%8a%d9%86/
LOCATION:Jackson Hall\, Mondavi Center
CATEGORIES:Stage & Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Al-Juthoor-Photo-3-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
