SUMMARY:Davis Queer Teen Group
DESCRIPTION:Davis Queer Teen Group \nOn the 4th Sunday of every month \n  \n\n\n\n\nOur mission is to provide a safe space to support\, educate\, reach out to and inspire people of all genders and orientations in and around Davis. Meetings are everything from support groups to educational lectures and community events. To join us\, email admin3@davisphoenixco.org
